'''Torch''' is a Python library intended to be used to generate type definitions or bindings for other languages without source code access from [[Decompiling game code|decompiled Java code]], such as with [[Umbrella (modding)|Umbrella]]. It was designed for the [[Rosetta Project]] to automatically generate the necessary Rosetta doc files.

